Technology for Cultural Heritage. Material for the PhD course in Imaging Techniques applied to Cultural Heritage. Università di Torino.

Workflow using open-source softwares:

1. RawTherapee for photo editing;
2. RealityScan for photogrammetry;
3. GigaMesh to unroll the shape;
4. CloudCompare for measuring and cross-sectioning;
5. Sketchfab to share.

**English:** Hello guys! In this project i created a 3d model of Cezve. I made it in Blender 3d, Marmoset and Substance Painter. Thanks for using my model in your works!

